# Typing @ at the start of a word is refused with a hint, while an e-mail address is ordinary text.
file <<END
- Email
END
see Email
keys <Enter>
type  me@example.com about @lunch
status Tags are set in Edit Node (e)
keys <Esc>
see - Email me@example.com about lunch
quit
saved <<END
- Email me@example.com about lunch
END
